"""Micras encoder slot: the main board's side of the board-to-board joint with an encoder board.

The encoder board (components/micras/EncoderTab) stands upright in a slot in the
main board, and its tab pads are soldered to 8 pads on the main board's top side,
4 on each side of the slot. Pad n here meets encoder tab pad n:

| Pad | Signal | Encoder tab side |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | CSn | bottom (pads 1-4) |
| 2 | CLK | bottom |
| 3 | MISO | bottom |
| 4 | MOSI | bottom |
| 5 | VDD (3.3 V) | top, chip side (pads 5-8) |
| 6 | GND | top |
| 7 | A | top |
| 8 | B | top |

Geometry (Altium MicrasLib ENCODER_CONNECTOR, MicrasMainBoard.PcbDoc):
- Pads 1.0 x 0.6 mm, 0.95 mm pitch along the slot (Y), the same pitch and
  0.6 mm width as the tab pads. Pads 1-4 at x = -1.16 mm, pads 5-8 at
  x = +1.16 mm, both rows from y = -1.425 mm (pads 1, 5) to y = +1.425 mm
  (pads 4, 8). Inner pad edges at x = +/-0.66 mm, 0.21 mm from the slot wall.
- The slot is a 0.90 x 5.10 mm rectangle on the board's Edge.Cuts, centred on
  the footprint origin and long along Y. It is board outline, not part of this
  footprint (the footprint draws it on F.Fab only), so the board's mechanical
  spec must place it with the footprint.
- The encoder board's chip side faces +X: seen from that side, tab pad 5
  (u = +1.425 mm in spec/encoder.toml's frame) lands at y = -1.425 mm, on pad 5.

Fit against spec/encoder.toml: tab width 5.0 mm in a 5.10 mm slot (0.05 mm per
end) and board thickness 0.80 mm in a 0.90 mm slot (0.05 mm per side), drawn
with square corners. A milled slot's ends are rounded by the router radius,
which shortens the full-width length available to the tab.

Not a purchased part: copper and a cut-out on the main board, so it is excluded
from the BOM and the placement file.
"""

load("@stdlib/interfaces.zen", "Spi")

# AS5047U DS v1-00 Figure 6: VDD = VDD3V3 = 3.0-3.6 V in 3.3 V mode, the mode the
# encoder board runs in (components/ams/AS5047U).
VDD = io(Power(voltage="3.0V to 3.6V"))
GND = io(Ground)
SPI = io(Spi)
A = io(Net)
B = io(Net)

Component(
    name="SLOT",
    prefix="EC",
    symbol=Symbol(library="EncoderSlot.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("EncoderSlot_2x4_P0.95mm.kicad_mod"),
    pins={
        "CSn": SPI.CS,
        "CLK": SPI.CLK,
        "MISO": SPI.MISO,
        "MOSI": SPI.MOSI,
        "VDD": VDD,
        "GND": GND,
        "A": A,
        "B": B,
    },
    skip_bom=True,
)
